Author: Cornel Pop [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Cornel Pop <cornel.pop@gmail.com>
Description: Provides an rgl-style 3D scene API backed by Swift and
    Apple's RealityKit/Metal stack. The package focuses first on the
    functions needed by Lithics3D.
